      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROCKIE'S GOLD (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (22.74) in a Mix 6/7 at Warrnambool. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. LEKTRA HANK (7) was out of the placings latest but three back was a Other winner in quick time (23.11) at this track in a Other. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Key player on best and worth another try. WHERE'S PADDY (5) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 5 lengths from the winner (17.89). The form out of last race has been strong. In the mix. PANAMA JAN (1) can measure up with the right run.",
